.SH "BUGS"
The \fBdebug\fR flag is hard\-coded to \fBTrue\fR at module level, overriding the \fBRECORD_DEBUG\fR environment variable check immediately above it\.
.P
The \fBsearch\fR method contains a partially commented\-out alternative implementation\. The active implementation may not correctly handle foreign\-key column searches under all Gremlin configurations\.
.P
\fBencodeIndex\fR and \fBdecodeIndex\fR use a byte\-by\-byte base\-256 encoding that may produce large integers for long strings; the authors note this may not be the best approach\.
.P
The \fBupdate\fR method for the Gremlin backend attempts to drop existing edges by edge identifier, but the deletion query uses the foreign\-key value as the edge identifier rather than the actual edge ID, which may not behave as intended in all Gremlin server configurations\.
